units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 1
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe etotal
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 100 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1000
run 220000
